title: "Truly Spatial Random Forests in 3D: spatial block cross-validation code"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a 3D voxel-kernel Spatial Random Forest and the
  spatial block cross-validation design used to evaluate it on an iron-ore
  deposit, together with the design ablation and hyperparameter sensitivity
  analyses reported in the accompanying paper.
